@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP ProjectForge. Basic Git/issue/board behavior belongs to separate ProjectForge, with independent user/resource authority.
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam activityBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #B99557
skinparam activityStartColor #163E52
skinparam activityEndColor #163E52
skinparam wrapWidth 190
skinparam maxMessageSize 180

title CF-M11 — Real Git read transfer or ref update
start
:CF-M11-S01\nInitiating actor\nAuthorized client requests\nclone/read transfer or supplies an\nintended push/ref change.;
if (CF-M11-S02\nSupported real Git capability and\nexact repository/action authority\nvalid?) then (yes)
if (CF-M11-S03\nRequest is read transfer?) then (yes)
:CF-M11-S04\nSystem\nEvaluate intended repository/ref\nread permission;
:CF-M11-S05\nSystem\nTransfer only permitted real\nrepository content;
if (CF-M11-S06\nTransfer actually completes?) then (yes)
:CF-M11-S07\nSystem\nReport actual authorized transfer;\nno write authority inferred;
stop
else (no)
:CF-M11-S08\nSystem\nReport incomplete/failed transfer,\nnot complete success;
stop
endif
else (no)
:CF-M11-S09\nClient / System\nIdentify proposed ref update and\nexpected current context;
:CF-M11-S10\nSystem\nRecheck current write/protected-\nref authority and ref condition;
if (CF-M11-S11\nExact ref update eligible and\ncontext current?) then (yes)
:CF-M11-S12\nSystem\nAttempt intended real ref update;
if (CF-M11-S13\nActual intended ref result\nconfirmed?) then (yes)
:CF-M11-S14\nSystem\nReport actual updated ref; no\nimplicit merge/deploy authority;
stop
else (no)
:CF-M11-S15\nSystem\nDistinguish\nrejected/conflicting/unknown ref\neffect; reconcile actual ref\nbefore retry;
stop
endif
else (no)
:CF-M11-S16\nSystem\nReject\nstale/protected/unauthorized\nupdate; no unrelated ref change;
stop
endif
endif
else (no)
:CF-M11-S17\nSystem\nDeny before prohibited effect or\nprotected disclosure; report unmet\ngate;
stop
endif
legend bottom
A: accepted profile core only. Other policy detail: P / proposed refinement.
Step IDs identify full descriptions in the activity view.
Logical ordering; no atomicity, runtime, timing or execution proof.
endlegend
@enduml
